WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.850
Jamie holds the drink while Ryu is stunned.

2
00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:02.100
The held drink reaches level 2 before the heavy hit.

3
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:02.750
Crouching heavy punch hits Ryu after the held drink.

4
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:03.600
OD Palm launches Ryu.

5
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.350
Crouching heavy kick picks up the launch.

6
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.050
The target kick continues before the drink follow-up.

7
00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:06.800
The sweep follow-up raises Jamie to drink level 3.
